<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Young et al. (1992) & Jaya et al. (2016) Emiliania huxleyi V/R calcite crystal coccolith rosette shield & interlocking spherical coccosphere mechanics — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements 3D V/R bimodal crystallographic nucleation (`evaluate_vr_crystallographic_ring_3d`, L123-185) and 3D T-shaped hammer-element rosette morphogenesis (`evaluate_coccolith_rosette_3d`, L191-295) with chiral suture imbrication (`psi = 18 deg`) and CAP-polysaccharide / calcite saturation modulation across morphotypes A, B, C, R and ocean acidification ablation (`Omega = 0.75`), plus 3D spherical coccosphere Voronoi/Delaunay Euler packing and buckling mechanics (`evaluate_coccosphere_3d_euler_packing`, L365-432). Backed by 4 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_080_emiliania_calcite_rosette.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

